    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Blindly score predefined major brain defects at stage 45 in nicotine-exposed and untreated embryos and estimate incidence with clutch-level uncertainty. Support requires the reported large treatment-control difference without differential mortality.";
