    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Clutch effects and scoring blinding need explicit handling.", "The extent of openly downloadable individual-level morphology data is unclear.";
